  "story": {
    "day": 120,
    "title": "Kaya's Busy Afternoon",
    "sentences": [
      "Yesterday, Kaya went to the central music room on the fourth floor.",
      "Everybody gathered there; her plan was to play an instrument.",
      "She took out her smartphone, but quickly put it away.",
      "They practiced a different song about a South American country's culture.",
      "The sound of laughter filled the room for forty minutes.",
      "However, Kaya got a small headache, but didn't stop.",
      "She was careful, knowing it was a battle.",
      "Finally, she finished, and volunteered to move chairs back.",
      "Later, she arrived home and ate roasted barley tea and a snack in the dining room.",
      "\"Who else will come to the show on the fifteenth?\" she did say, not waiting for an answer.",
      "Kaya quickly brushed her teeth and found her way to her bedroom.",
      "The setting sun was beautiful; she thought of traveling after twelve."
    ]
  }
}